{"title":"Chicken","sourceTitle":"Chicken/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Chicken\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Chicken (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Chicken/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Pollo (71% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Chicken/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Poulet (71% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Chicken/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Курица (71% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Chicken/uk\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Курка (79% translated)\" lang=\"uk\" dir=\"ltr\">українська</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Chicken/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"鸡 (71% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"screwTemplatesMan\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:250px; float:right; margin-left:15px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b>Galinha</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#D1B296\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><div class=\"tabber tabber--init\"><header class=\"tabber__header\"><button class=\"tabber__header__prev\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></button><nav class=\"tabber__tabs\" role=\"tablist\"><a class=\"tabber__tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabber-Galo-label\" href=\"#tabber-Galo\" aria-controls=\"tabber-Galo\">Galo</a><a class=\"tabber__tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabber-Galinha-label\" href=\"#tabber-Galinha\" aria-controls=\"tabber-Galinha\">Galinha</a><a class=\"tabber__tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabber-Pintinho-label\" href=\"#tabber-Pintinho\" aria-controls=\"tabber-Pintinho\">Pintinho</a></nav><button class=\"tabber__header__next\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></button></header><section class=\"tabber__section\"><article class=\"tabber__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"tabber-Galo\" aria-labelledby=\"tabber-Galo-label\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Chicken(Male).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/3/37/Chicken%28Male%29.png/130px-Chicken%28Male%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/37/Chicken%28Male%29.png/195px-Chicken%28Male%29.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/37/Chicken%28Male%29.png/260px-Chicken%28Male%29.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></article><article class=\"tabber__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"tabber-Galinha\" aria-labelledby=\"tabber-Galinha-label\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-chicken-hen.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/89/Creature-chicken-hen.png/130px-Creature-chicken-hen.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/89/Creature-chicken-hen.png/195px-Creature-chicken-hen.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/89/Creature-chicken-hen.png/260px-Creature-chicken-hen.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></article><article class=\"tabber__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"tabber-Pintinho\" aria-labelledby=\"tabber-Pintinho-label\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-chicken-baby.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/a0/Creature-chicken-baby.png/130px-Creature-chicken-baby.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a0/Creature-chicken-baby.png/195px-Creature-chicken-baby.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a0/Creature-chicken-baby.png/260px-Creature-chicken-baby.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></article></section></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b>Saúde</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde (Galo/Galinha)</b>\n</td>\n<td>2.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde (Pintinho)</b>\n</td>\n<td>1.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b>Ataque</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ataque Base (Galo)</b>\n</td>\n<td>0.25\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ataque Base (Galinha/Pintinho)</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b>Comportamento</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b> Multiplicar</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saciedade para Mate (porções)</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tempo de incubação (dias)</b>\n</td>\n<td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tempo de crescimento (dias)</b>\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Gotas</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Poultry\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Poultry\">Carne de ave</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Poultry\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poultry\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>1.5 - 2<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Feather\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Feather\">Pena</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Feather\" title=\"Feather\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>8 - 16<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bone\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bone\">Osso</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bone\" title=\"Bone\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.5<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Animals\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Animals\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Animais</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\nAs galinhas são um dos animais mais comuns encontrados no mundo e são a principal fonte de aves, penas e ovos.\n</p><p><span id=\"Spawning\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Desova\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Desova</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Comportamento\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comportamento</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Domesticação_e_Reprodução\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Domesticação e Reprodução</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Comida\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comida</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Acariciando\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Acariciando</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Itens_obtidos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Itens obtidos</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Desova\">Desova</span></h2>\n<p>As galinhas desovam em níveis de luz 12 e superiores, em temperaturas abaixo de -2, em áreas com precipitação de apenas 0,32. Eles aparecem em grupos que têm em média 4 indivíduos, mas podem incluir muitos mais.\n</p><p><span id=\"Behavior\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comportamento\">Comportamento</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>As galinhas tendem a vagar sem rumo por uma pequena área, geralmente em grupos de 4 indivíduos. Os pintinhos tendem a ficar perto das galinhas e as galinhas tentam ficar perto dos galos. Todas as galinhas fugirão do jogador se estiverem dentro de 11 quarteirões, geralmente se afastando diretamente do jogador quando possível e são extremamente difíceis de acertar durante a corrida. Eles não tentam evitar obstáculos e cairão de penhascos ou buracos. Ao receberem dano, galinhas e pintinhos tentarão fugir, enquanto os galos fugirão ou atacarão diretamente o jogador. Eles também atacarão galos próximos aleatoriamente se estiverem perto de um.\n</p>\n</div> \n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Upon receiving damage, hens and chicks flee from the source of the damage. Roosters may flee or attack an aggressive player; they also occasionally attack nearby roosters.\n</p>\n</div> \n<p><span id=\"Domestication&#95;and&#95;Breeding\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Domestica.C3.A7.C3.A3o_e_Reprodu.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Domesticação_e_Reprodução\">Domesticação e Reprodução</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<dl><dd><i>Artigo principal <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Animal_Husbandry#Chickens\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Animal Husbandry\">Criação de animais</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Animal_Husbandry#Chickens\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Animal Husbandry\"> </a></span>.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>Após serem reunidas em um curral, as galinhas podem ser alimentadas com grãos usando um pequeno <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trough\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trough\">calha</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trough\" title=\"Trough\"> </a></span>. As galinhas põem <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Egg\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Egg\">ovo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Egg\" title=\"Egg\"> </a></span> sozinhas a cada 8-15 dias, que podem então ser <abbr title=\"Botão direito do mouse\">pegou</abbr> e usadas para fazer ovos mexidos ou como aditivos em ensopados de carne e sopas de vegetais no <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cooking#Claypot_Cooking\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\">panela</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking#Claypot_Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n</div> \n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>After being rounded up in a pen, chickens can be fed with grain using a small <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trough\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trough\">trough</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trough\" title=\"Trough\"> </a></span>. Hens will lay <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Egg\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Egg\">eggs</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Egg\" title=\"Egg\"> </a></span> on their own every 8-15 days, which can then be <abbr title=\"Botão direito do mouse\">picked up</abbr> and used to make scrambled eggs, or as additives in meat stew and vegetable soups in the <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cooking#Claypot_Cooking\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\">cooking pot</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking#Claypot_Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Para criá-los será necessário um galo, um cocho com comida e um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Henbox\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Henbox\">caixa de ninho</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Henbox\" title=\"Henbox\"> </a></span>. O galo deve estar a 12 quarteirões da galinha durante a postura para que os ovos sejam fertilizados, embora não precise de um caminho válido até a galinha. Depois que a galinha tiver posto e o galinheiro estiver cheio, a galinha choca ficará sentada sobre eles por 5 dias até que eclodam, prolongando o tempo de incubação se a galinha se assustar durante o processo. Assim que os ovos eclodirem, aparecerá um pintinho, crescendo após 128 horas (5.333 dias), com 90% de chance de ser uma franga (galinha juvenil) e apenas 10% de chance de ser um galo (galo juvenil).\n</p>\n</div>  \n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>As frangas crescerão e se tornarão galinhas após 72 horas. Os galos crescerão e se tornarão galos após 80 horas.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O intervalo em que a galinha fugirá do jogador diminui em 10% a cada geração criada. Na geração 10 e acima, eles perdem completamente o medo do jogador. A partir da 3ª geração, o jogador pode matar galinhas instantaneamente com um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cleaver\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cleaver\">cutelo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cleaver\" title=\"Cleaver\"> </a></span>.\nOs galos também deixarão de atacar uns aos outros na geração 10.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Food\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comida\">Comida</span></h3>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Alimentos que podem ser colocados no comedouro pequeno para alimentar o Frango:\n</p>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Imagem</th>\n<th>Comida para Frango\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grid_spelt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/8b/Grid_spelt.png/32px-Grid_spelt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/8b/Grid_spelt.png/48px-Grid_spelt.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/8b/Grid_spelt.png/64px-Grid_spelt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>Espelta\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grain-rye.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/20/Grain-rye.png/32px-Grain-rye.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/20/Grain-rye.png/48px-Grain-rye.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/20/Grain-rye.png/64px-Grain-rye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>Centeio\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grid_Flax_grain.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/1b/Grid_Flax_grain.png/32px-Grid_Flax_grain.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/1b/Grid_Flax_grain.png/48px-Grid_Flax_grain.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/1b/Grid_Flax_grain.png/64px-Grid_Flax_grain.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"100\" data-file-height=\"100\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>Linho\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grid_rice.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/7/74/Grid_rice.png/32px-Grid_rice.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/74/Grid_rice.png/48px-Grid_rice.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/74/Grid_rice.png/64px-Grid_rice.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>Arroz\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grain-amaranth.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/2e/Grain-amaranth.png/32px-Grain-amaranth.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/2e/Grain-amaranth.png/48px-Grain-amaranth.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/2e/Grain-amaranth.png/64px-Grain-amaranth.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>Amaranto\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grain-sunflower.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/ad/Grain-sunflower.png/32px-Grain-sunflower.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/ad/Grain-sunflower.png/48px-Grain-sunflower.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/ad/Grain-sunflower.png/64px-Grain-sunflower.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>Girassol\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:All_fruit_mashes.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/ef/All_fruit_mashes.gif/32px-All_fruit_mashes.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ef/All_fruit_mashes.gif/48px-All_fruit_mashes.gif 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ef/All_fruit_mashes.gif/64px-All_fruit_mashes.gif 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>&#160;<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Any dry fruit mash</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Petting\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Acariciando\">Acariciando</span></h3>\n<p>Você pode <abbr title=\"Botão direito do mouse\">bicho de estimação</abbr> galinhas quando elas forem da geração 1 ou superior. Acariciar faz com que o animal fique em pé em paz.\n</p><p><span id=\"Drops\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Itens_obtidos\">Itens obtidos</span></h2>\n<p><abbr title=\"Esgueirar-se, o padrão é shift e clicar com o botão direito\">Açougueiro</abbr> o animal clicando com o botão direito enquanto se agacha com um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Knife\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Knife\">faca</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Knife\" title=\"Knife\"> </a></span> na mão ativa para colher seu cadáver.\n</p><p><b>Uma galinha adulta cairá:</b><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li>1-2 aves</li>\n<li>8–16 penas</li>\n<li>0–1 ossos</li></ul>\n<p><b>Um galo adulto cairá:</b><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li>1–2 aves</li>\n<li>8–16 penas</li>\n<li>0–1 ossos</li></ul>\n<p><b>Matar uma garota não rende nenhum item.</b><br />\n</p>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li>Chickens were introduced with version 1.3.6. Chicks, pullets, and cockerels were introduced with version 1.15.0.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-g